<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunkers steady, 180-cst at $100-$103/T.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunkers steady, 180-cst at $100-$103/T.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore bunker quotes held steady with a shipowner seen buying a 180-cst parcel at $100 per tonne, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have bought a 180-cst parcel at $100 per tonne,&quot; said one shipowner. But bunker 180-cst cargo was quoted by most majors at around $102-103, said buyers. Bunker 380-cst supplies were quoted $97-98.</p>
<p>Traders said bunker sales have been thin this week and most majors were disposing their excess supplies in the cargo market. They expected the trend to continue in the near term.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870 3082)</p>
</text>
